$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: Step A. To a mixture of
6-amino-2,10-dihydro-9-oxa-1,2,4a-triaza-phenanthren-3-one (intermediate
obtained at Step D during preparation of Compound 15a, 0.055 g, 0.25
mmol), azetidine-1,3-dicarboxylic acid 1-mono-tert-butyl ester (0.055 g,
0.275 mmol) and N,N-diisopropylethylamine (0.065 g, 0.5 mmol) in DMF (2
mL) was added HATU (0.114 g, 0.3 mmol) and the mixture was stirred at
ambient temperature for 5 h. Water (10 mL) was added and the reaction
mixture was stirred for 1 h. The reaction mixture was filtered, the
filter cake was washed with water (10 mL), and the solid was dried in
vacuo. Prepared according to the procedure of 15m using: Step A:
piperidine-1,4-dicarboxylic acid mono-tert-butyl ester (1.5 equiv),
N,N-diisopropylethylamine (1.2 equiv), DMF (14 vol equiv) and HATU (1.5
equiv) at ambient temperature for 4 h; 0.147 g, 93%, as a white solid.
